                  "explanation": "Review tab → Check Accessibility opens the inspection sidebar. (File → Info → Check for Issues → Check Accessibility works too.) Designer is a layout tool, not an accessibility tool.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Quiz: Open the Checker</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Which ribbon path?</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"780\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Where is Check Accessibility?</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">A. Insert tab → Check Accessibility</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">B. Design tab → Designer</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\">C. Review tab → Check Accessibility</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"455\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">D. View tab → Accessibility Pane</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"510\" width=\"860\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"560\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Why C</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"615\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Review tab groups proofing and review tools:</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Spelling, Thesaurus, Smart Lookup, Translate,</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"685\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Check Accessibility, Comments, Compare</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"745\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Alt path: File → Info → Check for Issues →</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"780\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Check Accessibility</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"1010\" width=\"900\" height=\"70\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1055\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Review tab — proofing tools live together</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "The Review tab gathers spelling, comments, and accessibility audits."
                  }
